se please fix this. &nbsp;It is unplayable in this configuration (and shielding winds is important to surviving the environment, esp. When the vat comes out that destroys all other vats)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Am I the only one seeing this?</p><p>&nbsp;Thanks for letting me vent.</p><p>i really do love the game and want it fixed so I can continue playing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
